Node ID=30 tainted
Text=<The guard's eyes go to your face, and then carefully past it.> You came up the road and through the gate, citizen, and the gate is not mine to argue with. You have your permission and I have my orders, and I would as soon neither of us tested the other today. Keep to the plaza, and if an Inquisitor asks, you and I have not spoken.
